I've arranged a taxi search for December 10, 2024, at 9:00 AM, picking up from Tokyo Station (1 Chome-9 Marunouchi, Chiyoda City, Tokyo) and dropping off at Tokyo Tower (4-chōme-2-8 Shibakōen, Minato City, Tokyo). The route is about 4.3 km and takes ~16 minutes, depending on traffic.

Available options (prices in USD, for up to the specified passengers/bags; non-refundable with 24-hour cancellation notice; no meet-and-greet service):

